- `QuestApplyResult Apply(QuestEvent e)`: enum? Could return bool changed. Need to know if quest completed to trigger consequences. Director can check `log.State` before/after. Return bool (progress advanced). Keep simple.
  - if State != Active → false.
  - current = CurrentObjective; if null → false.
