- If `_quest == null`, `_quest.QuestId` in OnDialogueAction would NRE? We return if `_log == null`; `_log` null when _quest null. Good.
- If action questId nonempty and `_quest` null, `_log` null → return before `_quest.QuestId`. Good.
- Default switch no-op for Grant actions. Compiler may warn "not all enum values handled"? Switch statement doesn't require exhaustive. Fine.
- `OnPlaced` slot param unused; can name `_`? C# allows `_`. Use `(CarrySlot _, Carryable item)`? The parameter name `_` is fine but maybe convention. Use `slot` and ignore; compiler no warning for unused parameters. Fine.
- Could use `_log.Apply` result to trigger quest completion but not now.

