private QuestAsset _asset;

[TearDown] public void TearDown() { if (_asset != null) Object.DestroyImmediate(_asset); _asset = null; }

private QuestAsset NewQuest()
{
    _asset = ScriptableObject.CreateInstance<QuestAsset>();
    _asset.hideFlags = HideFlags.DontSave;
    _asset.SetIdentity("train_batteries", "BATTERIES");
    _asset.AddObjective(new QuestObjective("q_talk_intro", "Talk", QuestObjectiveKind.Talk, "R13_Prospector"));
    _asset.AddObjective(new QuestObjective("q_load", "Load", QuestObjectiveKind.Deliver, "battery", 4));
    _asset.AddObjective(new QuestObjective("q_talk_done", "Report", QuestObjectiveKind.Talk, "R13_Prospector"));
    return _asset;
}
```
Tests:
1. `NewLog_IsInactive` — State Inactive, CurrentObjective null, ObjectiveCount 3.
2. `Activate_StartsTalkObjective` — true, state Active, CurrentObjective q_talk_intro, progress 0.
3. `Activate_Twice_DoesNothing` — second false, state Active, index 0.
4. `OutOfOrderEvent_IsIgnored` — Activate; Apply Deliver battery 1 → false, progress 0, current talk.
5. `WrongTarget_IsIgnored` — Activate; Apply Talk "R12" → false.
6. `Talk_CompletesIntro` — Activate; Apply Talk R13 → true; current q_load, index 1, progress 0.
7. `Deliver_AccumulatesUntilRequired` — Activate; Talk; Apply Deliver 1/2/3 → true and progress 1/2/3; current q_load; Apply 4 → true, current q_talk_done, index 2, progress 0.
8. `Deliver_OvershootCompletes` — Apply 10 → completes q_load; no progress > required. Not necessary but okay.
9. `FinalTalk_CompletesQuest` — fill; Apply Talk R13 → true; State Completed, CurrentObjective null, IsCompleted.
10. `Completed_IgnoresFurtherEvents` — after complete, Apply Deliver/Talk → false, State Completed.
11. `ZeroOrNegativeAmount_IsIgnored` — Activate; Apply Talk amount 0 → false; -1 → false.
12. `WrongKind_IsIgnored` — Activate; Apply Reach R13 → false.
13. `Snapshot_ReflectsProgress` — Activate; Talk; Deliver 2 → snapshot State Active, ObjectiveIndex 1, Progress 2.
14. `NullQuest_IsInert` — new QuestLog(null): State Inactive, ObjectiveCount 0, Activate false, Apply false, snapshot Inactive.
15. `QuestWithoutObjectives_DoesNotActivate` — empty asset with identity; Activate false. But `SetIdentity` with hideFlags DontSave no logs. Good.

