- Set `_label.font = TMP_Settings.defaultFontAsset`; if null, TextMeshPro may use default. Fine.
- World-space TMP needs `_label.enableWordWrapping = false`? Not necessary.
- The marker might render inside wall? Position above R13 at y 2.35; okay.
- Add a subtle outline? Not necessary.
