- [MainMenuScreen.cs:347](file:///F:/Unity%20Projects/FrostSpace/Assets/_Project/Scripts/Features/Menu/MainMenuScreen.cs#L347) — русские кнопки и настройки, кириллический шрифт.
- [PauseMenuScreen.cs:23](file:///F:/Unity%20Projects/FrostSpace/Assets/_Project/Scripts/Features/Menu/PauseMenuScreen.cs#L23) — новый экран паузы, журнал, шестерёнка.
- Сцены: [Train.unity](file:///F:/Unity%20Projects/FrostSpace/Assets/Scenes/Train.unity), [MainMenu.unity](file:///F:/Unity%20Projects/FrostSpace/Assets/Scenes/MainMenu.unity), [Game.unity](file:///F:/Unity%20Projects/FrostSpace/Assets/Scenes/Game.unity).
