#### Thinking

Now check DialogueContentTests and Train dialogue data format to author consistent content. Also check Editor DialogueAsset creation constraints (must use ScriptableObject.CreateInstance). We can create assets via execute_code and AssetDatabase.CreateAsset.

Let's inspect existing dialogue assets via SerializedObject to see lines/nodes and how to set fields.

#### Tool: Bash

**Input:**

```json
{
  "command": "cat > Temp/dump_dialogue.cs <<'EOF'\nvar sb = new System.Text.StringBuilder();\nvar guids = UnityEditor.AssetDatabase.FindAssets(\"t:DialogueAsset\");\nforeach (var g in guids)\n{\n    var path = UnityEditor.AssetDatabase.GUIDToAssetPath(g);\n    var asset = UnityEditor.AssetDatabase.LoadAssetAtPath<FrostSpace.Features.Dialogue.DialogueAsset>(path);\n    sb.AppendLine(\"=== \" + path + \" start=\" + asset.StartId + \" nodes=\" + asset.Nodes.Count);\n    foreach (var n in asset.Nodes)\n    {\n        sb.AppendLine(\"  \" + n.Id + \" action=\" + n.Action + \" q=\" + n.QuestId + \" next='\" + n.NextId + \"' choices=\" + n.Choices.Count + \" line=\" + n.Line);\n        foreach (var c in n.Choices) sb.AppendLine(\"     choice: \" + c.Text + \" -> '\" + c.NextId + \"'\");\n    }\n}\nreturn sb.ToString();\nEOF\nUNITY_MCP_PORT=6401 python Tools/Unity/unity_bridge.py call execute_code \"$(python -c 'import json; print(json.dumps({\"action\":\"execute\",\"code\":open(\"Temp/dump_dialogue.cs\",encoding=\"utf-8\").read()}))')\" 2>&1 | tail -80",
  "description": "Dump all dialogue assets"
}
```

**Response:**

ответ за 0.4 с
{
  "status": "success",
  "result": {
