R13 pivot at feet (model root bounds center ~1.05, so pivot at bottom). R13 in Train at y=0 with Train floor y=0. In Frontier platform top 0.6 => R13 y=0.6, not 0.7. Use 0.61. R16 current y=0.7? They stand on platform top 0.6 but pivot 0.7 -> 0.1 above, likely because CharacterController root? They have no CC. Bounds center 1.52, size 1.97 -> bottom 0.535, slightly below platform 0.6. Their pivot seems not at feet? R16 model pivot at 0.7? Bounds bottom 0.535. Hmm model pivot maybe at feet but bounds extends below due to pose. Fine. For R13 set y=0.6.

R8 pivot? R8 bounds height 1.92 from pivot; set y=0.6 on platform. R8 at gate on platform y=0.6.

Cart pivot at y=0 in Train (floor). On platform top 0.6 => cart y=0.6. Bounds y 1.15 (from floor), so top 1.75. Slots local y 0.55 -> world 1.15; battery bottom at 1.15, top 2.1. Good.

R13 height 2.09, cart+ batteries top 2.1. R13 visible.

Door panel from y=0.6 to 3.0 (2.4 tall), cart top 1.75 fits.

