Move helper:
```
private static IEnumerator Move(Transform t, Vector3 from, Vector3 to, float seconds){
  var elapsed=0f;
  while(elapsed < seconds){ elapsed+=Time.deltaTime; var k=Mathf.SmoothStep(0,1,Mathf.Clamp01(elapsed/seconds)); t.position=Vector3.LerpUnclamped(from,to,k); yield return null;}
  t.position=to;
}
```
