For arrays, helper:
```
void SetArray(Object c, string n, Object[] values) {
 var so = new SerializedObject(c);
 var p = so.FindProperty(n);
 p.arraySize = values.Length;
 for i... GetArrayElementAtIndex(i).objectReferenceValue=values[i];
 so.ApplyModifiedPropertiesWithoutUndo();
}
```
